        "slc_cfd1b0c06fe771f07215ba55a5666d9cfdc465421e43c48f4091fe844d6d5d5a"
      ],
      "text": "NeoCode has two agent modes: PLAN for read-only investigation and BUILD for implementation; the /agents command switches between the corresponding agents."
    },
