        "slc_188647f0a0c1108ab951736c6d0739813f7525e42ab909687bd318d3d7a832dd"
      ],
      "text": "NeoLens is a local codebase explorer with three views: Graph (TypeScript dependency relationships), Workspace (read-only file previews and capped search), and Timeline (tool-activity replay with token, duration, and estimated cost summaries)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
